# AWS-0104: unrestricted egress on the EKS control-plane security group.
# The control plane must reach the AWS API, the container registry, and the
# node ENIs. Restricting its egress is not supported by EKS and would break
# cluster operation. Node and workload egress are governed separately by
# Kubernetes NetworkPolicy; see guides/networking.md.
AVD-AWS-0104
